---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Who Writes Wealth Notes | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About Wealth Notes, a personal finance blog covering budgeting, saving, investing, and building wealth with confidence." />
		<style>
			main {
				max-width: 760px;
				padding: 3rem 1rem 5rem;
			}
			p {
				line-height: 1.7;
			}
			h1 {
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About Wealth Notes</h1>
			<p>
				Wealth Notes is a personal finance blog for people who want to build better money habits without feeling overwhelmed. I write about budgeting, saving, investing, debt strategy, and financial design for everyday life.
			</p>
			<p>
				The goal is simple: practical advice that helps you make smarter decisions, reduce financial stress, and create more freedom over time.
			</p>
			<p>
				This is not about hustle culture or unrealistic wealth myths. It is about clear systems, sustainable habits, and long-term thinking.
			</p>
			<p>
				Every article here starts from a real, common money problem — an emergency fund that never grows, a credit card balance that keeps creeping up, an investing decision that feels too complicated to start. The goal is to break that problem down into a plan you can follow this week, not someday.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you are just getting started, the <a href="/blog">Journal</a> is the best place to browse. New guides go up regularly, covering budgeting frameworks, beginner investing, and debt payoff strategy in plain language.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
